Q1. Import a sample API request for creating a new playlist (POST /playlists) from a shared Postman collection link into your Postman workspace and send a request with your own playlist name and description.

Steps:

1. Open Postman.
2. Click on Import button.
3. Paste the shared collection link or select the collection file.
4. Import the collection.
5. Open POST /playlists request.
6. Select Body → Raw → JSON.
7. Enter the following data:

{
    "name":"My Bollywood Playlist",
    "description":"Top Hindi Songs Collection"
}

8. Click Send.
9. Verify that the playlist is created successfully.